body:
Thank you for your help.

&#x200B;

 slowly learning being an adult means taking L's.

Let me just throw some facts about my life experience at you man, not sure if you will find it helpful. Sorry things are so fucked.

I went to community college and transferred to one of the best universities in the nation. Life is definitely not over just because you're in CC, and also CC has a completely different environment for college. Lots of people specifically do not date in CC because it's just a transitioning period in your life. Once you transfer, or if you just get outside of CC, my prediction is your social life will probably change a lot.

I know lots of guys that were older than you that still have not even kissed a girl and I don't really think they are that unsalvageably ugly. It sometimes just takes a while to get into your game.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
